  "details": "The Mime Mail module gives Drupal sites the ability to send HTML email messages.\n\nUnder rare site configuration conditions, a user with the ability to send HTML emails could send non-public data that had been uploaded to the files directory,\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact the attacker would need advance knowledge of uploaded files, and to send HTML emails and set the recipient list.",
